  'gpuCheck.heroHeading': 'Will WhisPaste run on my GPU?',
  'gpuCheck.heroLead': 'Almost certainly yes. Pick your system below to see which compute backend WhisPaste uses, how much graphics memory it wants, and what happens when the GPU is missing, old or simply broken.',
  'gpuCheck.tldr': 'Short answer: WhisPaste never requires a GPU. On Windows and Linux it accelerates through Vulkan, which covers NVIDIA, AMD and Intel with a single build; on Apple Silicon it uses Metal. Everywhere else — outdated driver, no dedicated card, a machine that simply refuses — it runs the model on the CPU. 8 GB of RAM is the only hard requirement, and it is checked at startup.',
